hs for a female. Room is available to move in from 15th August.  semester students or interns. Very cosy and warm in winter, clean and available to move in. Shared bathroom next door. Will be joining a family in the house. Looking for a respectful and clean lady. Bills (internet, refuse, gas, electricity) will be shared monthly 1/3. The cost of the room is €700 per month, and a reimbursable deposit of €700 is required when moving in. The location of the house is very convenient in quiet area and at the same time close to bus stops to the city and further. Message me for more details if required.','Double Room','cork','{"distances_km": {"centre": 4.12}}',1,NULL);
