We are offering a bright and comfortable bedroom in our modern 4-bedroom house, situated in an elevated location with breathtaking views overlooking Cork City and beyond.

The available bedroom enjoys beautiful direct views of the city and is filled with natural light, thanks to two large windows on different sides of the room. It comes furnished with a small double bed, mattress, and a large wardrobe. The bathroom is conveniently located right next to the bedroom and will be shared with one other female occupant. Utility bills are included in the rent if not working from home.

About Us

We are a friendly and easygoing family of four: a couple in our mid-thirties, our 4-year-old child, and a sister in her mid-thirties. We are looking for a respectful and easygoing tenant who would feel comfortable living in a family environment.

Location & Transport

The house is approximately a 15-minute walk to the nearest Bus 216 stop. However, ','Double Room','cork','{"distances_km": {"centre": 4.76}}',1,NULL);
