Large ,safe,parking area adjacent the house.
Rooms will be available from 10th September.
 5mins from Blarney  village,20 mins by car from Cork city.Close to apple,UCC, & Cork hospitals.

Bedroom 1 & 2 both double rooms.
 775 per month includes all  bills.
Both rooms, are upstairs, and are bright,cosy,rooms. Centrally heated and window blinds.
There is a  landing area, used as a seating area between the two rooms. There is a toilet with basin at one end of the landing.

There is also a large bathroom downstairs, with all facilities,shared between the two bedrooms/lodgers, (Owner has own bathroom.)
Large country kitchen & dining table with coal stove & adjoining utility room, with all necessary appliances,shared by lodgers & homeowner (.see photos )

Bills include-            wifi,refuse,electrici','Double Room','cork','{"distances_km": {"centre": 7.01}}',1,NULL);
