Looking for affordable accommodation in a great Cork City location, while also having the opportunity to make a positive difference in someone’s life?

We have a lovely Homeshare opportunity in Douglas, Cork, sharing with a very independent older lady who enjoys her own routine and independence but would welcome the companionship and reassurance that comes from having someone else around the home.

Large single bedroom ensuite available as well as a shared kitchen and access to a seating area close to the bedroom.

This could be a great fit for a mature, friendly and easy-going female who is looking for somewhere comfortable to call home rather than simply renting a room.

The location is a real bonus. The home is within easy reach of Douglas Village, with supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, pharmacies, shopping centres and other everyday amenities nearby. St Finbarr’s Hospital is also conveniently accessible.

There are public transport connecti','Double Room','cork','{"distances_km": {"centre": 2.79}}',1,NULL);
