Although we are a 15 minute walk to the scairt cross 207 bus stop, a car is essential as the road is without a footpath for a few hundred metres.

We are a family of three: couple in our mid-thirties and a 10 month old baby. We ask that any potential tenants have a genuine good regard for babies/children and don''t feel put out by this arrangement. The baby does not make noise overnight but does wake at 6/7am, and there would be noise at this time. 

The tenant''s bedroom has a new double bed and mattress and access next door to the main bathroom, which has constant hot water. I am currently on a career break so I am here a lot during the day. We are an easygoing couple and would hope that our home is welcoming and comfortable for you.

Please note: bills are an','Double Room','cork','{"distances_km": {"centre": 5.6}}',1,NULL);
