Both rooms are furnished with a bed, mattress and wardrobe. The two rooms share an upstairs bathroom, and there is also an additional toilet and sink downstairs.

The larger double room is €750 per month and the smaller double is €650 per month. Bills will be split evenly between the three of us and are expected to work out at approximately €60 per person per month.

You''ll be sharing with me — I''m a professional woman in my early 30s and I''m easy-going, friendly, clean and tidy. I''m hoping to find housemates at a similar stage of life who are friendly, considerate and reliable. I''d love the house to have a relaxed and sociable atmosphere, where we can have a chat in the kitchen or occasionally have a drink or dinner together.

