All bills are included.

I’m looking for someone who:
- Is looking for a short-term, 6-month stay
- Is quiet, clean and responsible

The house is ideally located in the heart of Glanmire, just a 5-minute walk from the bus stop, making commuting very convenient. Supermarkets, cafés and other essential amenities are all close by.

The house also has a lovely garden which gets the afternoon and evening sun.

A Monday–Friday let may also be considered if this would suit you better.

If interested, please send a brief message telling me a little about yourself and confirming that a 6-month let from mid-September to mid-March suits you.','Double Room','cork','{"distances_km": {"centre": 6.75}}',1,NULL);
