We are looking for someone who would fit naturally into that environment — ideally a non-smoker, clean and responsible, and someone who understands and enjoys living as part of a shared household.

This is not a party house. We value a peaceful atmosphere, good communication, cleanliness and mutual respect. At the same time, it is a happy and sociable home — we like getting to know the people we live with rather than simply sharing the same address.

The house is fully equipped, comfortable and kept to a very good standard.

