Hosting Power - providing affordable accommodation in Ireland since 2014. 

We are proud to advertise this fully furnished and comfortable private room.
The house is equipped with all modern conveniences and you share it with your welcoming host. 

All bills (electricity, gas, etc.) are included in the rent! All bedding will be provided too. 

How to book this room:
For the fastest and easiest way to book this room, please go to our website: hostingpower.ie
