oom','A bright room is available in a wellkept, modern 4bed semidetached house. The home is quiet, tidy, and run with respect for each other’s space and schedules.

About the household
Three adults currently live here, all working fulltime. The house is calm, organised, and suited to someone who appreciates a clean environment and easygoing housemates.

Ideal occupant
Someone in stable employment, who is clean, respectful, and comfortable living in a shared home. Friendly but independent suits the house dynamic well.

The room & house

• Single room with 4ft bed (large single/ small double)
• Modern kitchen and living area
• Highspeed broadband
• Parking available
• Close to shops, bus routes, and local amenities


What’s included:
The monthly fee includes bins, WiFi, TV licence.

What’s not included:
