The room is available on a 5-night basis, Sunday evening to Friday, well suited to a student who returns home at weekends.

The apartment is in an excellent city-centre location, within easy reach of colleges, shops, supermarkets, cafés, public transport and all city-centre amenities.

The property is located within a safe, secure and well-maintained apartment building, offering peace of mind while living in the city.

The accommodation includes a comfortable private bedroom, with the student also having private use of the main bathroom, as the other occupant has their own en-suite.

All bills are included, including electricity/heating, high-speed fibre broadband and rubbish removal.

A comfortable, convenient and secure home-from-home for a student who wants to be based in the city during the college week without paying for unn','Double Room','limerick','{"distances_km": {"centre": 0.43}}',1,NULL);
