Double Room -- Deposit Amount: 650Euro --- 

Monthly Rent 650 Euro + Shared Bills 

The room is available for rent in Raheen''s safe and secure area. It has plenty of storage and pleasant decor. The living room has a TV and Channels. There is a lovely, enclosed back garden, and there is secure car parking in the front.

The house is near Limerick University Hospital, Mary-I, and Raheen Industrial Estate. It is conveniently located near local shops, Bars, a gym, Restaurants, Churches, and the Crescent Shopping Centre. 

A Bus Stop is nearby, and it is regularly a two-minute walk. The bus, Bus No. 304, goes directly to the City Centre and the University of Limerick every 15 minutes. The Route is UL—City Centre—Raheen—Ballycumin village.

NO SMOKING in the house. 

Bills are not included in the rent and are typically shared monthly among housemates.

The cumulative utility Bills include gas, Electricity, 1000MB Broadband, Waste and Recycling, house cleaning pro','Double Room','limerick','{"distances_km": {"centre": 4.23}}',1,NULL);
