tYTZlYWNjNzgzMjE0LnBuZyJ9?signature=1c0a24a64516362a50c9585d2914894a71357be4d6195d2d13bd5b536b7fec84"}, "state": "PUBLISHED", "premierPartner": false, "facilities": [{"key": "CENTRAL_HEATING", "name": "Central Heating"}, {"key": "WHEELCHAIR_ACCESS", "name": "Wheelchair Access"}, {"key": "INTERNET", "name": "Internet"}, {"key": "GARDEN_PATIO_BALCONY", "name": "Garden / Patio / Balcony"}, {"key": "CONCIERGE", "name": "Concierge"}, {"key": "GYM", "name": "Gym"}, {"key": "RESIDENTS_LOUNGE", "name": "Residents Lounge"}, {"key": "COMMUNITY_EVENTS", "name": "Community Events"}, {"key": "LAUNDRY", "name": "Laundry"}], "betterBest": false}','2026-09-10T02:45:32.955513+00:00','2026-09-10T18:43:35.311093+00:00',1,0,'daft','EUR',1322,305,'2026-07-13',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Welcome to Heyday Carman’s Hall in The Liberties , your base for student life in Dublin. Trinity College and the Royal College of Surgeons are a 20-minute walk, and TU Dublin is just 10 minutes away. Please note - the property can only accommodate students - we cannot accept applications from people who are not currently attending university.

Designed to support both academic success and student wellbeing, Heyday offers fully furnished private en-suite rooms with high-speed broadband, dedicated study spaces, and comfortable communal living areas.

Residents benefit from premium on-site amenities including a gym, cinema room, café, courtyard, laundry facilities, 24-hour reception, and secure access. With a strong focus on community, safety, and convenience, HEYDAY provides an ideal environment for students to learn, socialise, and enjoy independent city living.','1 bed','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 1.53}}',1,NULL);
