The area is well served by the Luas Red Line and multiple bus routes, including direct connections to UCD, making it a popular choice for students commuting across the city. It offers a vibrant atmosphere while remaining convenient for both study and day-to-day living.

A range of en-suite rooms are available for the 2026/27 academic year and full-year bookings, with prices starting from €325 per week, inclusive of bills. Rooms are single-occupancy and typically range from 12m² to 22m², featuring a small double bed, private en-suite bathroom, and fully furnished layout including study space and storage. Apartments are shared with 3–8 other res','1 bed','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 1.5}}',1,NULL);
