ions/ colleges, including the new Grangegorman Educational Campus, Trinity College, The Kings Inn, DIT and Dublin Business School and the City Centre, O''Connell Street/ Henry Street, Dublins main shopping and entertainment district. Wifi service and bin collections are included in the rental price. The layout of the ','1 bed','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 1.1}}',1,NULL);
