ehind the Civic Centre). Reasonably tidy and very private. Just one bill - electric (shared between the two!), wifi incl''d. Conveniently located, all shops either *right in the building* (Centra, Chinese takeaway, off-licence, chemist/pharmacy) or *at hand* (chipper, barber, supervalu, travelodge bar). OmniPark Shopping Santry close by with cinema etc. Close to DCU, IKEA, AIRPORT. Not far from city centre. To express interest, whatsapp Andrew 086-8799331 to introduce yourself. VIEWING DAILY. PLEASE KINDLY W.APP TO CONFIRM ATTENDANCE.','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 5.66}}',1,NULL);
