m','Two rooms are available to rent in a newly renovated house near DCU in Dublin 9.
The property is approximately a 10-minute walk from DCU and is in a very convenient location. A SPAR convenience store is around 2 minutes’ walk away, with a pharmacy and takeaway restaurants approximately 3–5 minutes away. Tesco is around a 15-minute walk from the house.
There are convenient bus routes nearby, including E1, E2 and 44, with direct access to Dublin city centre.
The house has three bedrooms in total, and two rooms are currently available:
One spacious double/master bedroom – €1,200 per month.
One single bedroom – €700 per month.
The other single bedroom has already been rented and is currently occupied by a female tenant.
The house is newly renovated, clean and well maintained, with a back garden and parking available. The bathroom and common areas are shared.
The property is very suitable for people studying or working near DCU.
Please contact me for more information or to arrange a viewing','Single & Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 4.63}}',1,NULL);
