Every type of shop within a few minutes walk, including SuperValu, Dunnes, Lidl and Aldi. A choice of cafes, restaurants and pubs all within a few minutes walk. Public amenities including a library, a swimming pool, tennis courts and a gym all only a few minutes walk away. 

Very quiet household - looking for very quiet tenants. 

This is a strictly non-smoking, non-vaping property inside and outside. Looking for tenants who do not smoke or vape. 

Please email with details of your accommodation needs if you would like more information. Make sure you mention how long you need accommodation for, inc','Single Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 5.38}}',1,NULL);
