€800 per month – all bills included
Available from mid-September 2026

Bright, comfortable and fully furnished room available in a beautiful red-brick period cottage in Irishtown, Dublin 4, minutes from Bath Avenue and the Aviva Stadium.

This is a Sunday evening to Friday arrangement, ideally suited to a male university student studying in Dublin during the week who normally returns to their family home at weekends.

The house is owner-occupied, sharing with one friendly, quiet male (young, Irish working professional), and offers a peaceful and comfortable Dublin base in an excellent location.

-- The Room --
The bedroom is comfortable, quiet and located at the rear of the cottage overlooking the courtyard garden. It is fully furnished and move-in ready, including:
