2) Middle room with en-suite ,singlebed ,study table,wardrope.
3) kitchen with dinning table and three chairs.

The rent is from Euro 730 for each person for each month including the bills. Deposit euro 800 for each person.

Spacious house in a quiet residential area in a cul-de-sac. Front and rear gardens, 

Gas fired central heating, washing machine in the utility room.

Very close to UCD Smurfit Business School and UCD Belfield  main campus. Shopping centre nearby. Also very good bus and dart services.Very close to bus stops for 46A City center and sandyford .
