Seeking a tenant from Sunday or Monday to Friday so the room may suit someone coming to work in Dublin during the week but travelling home at the weekend. 

Monthly rent of €525 with a separate fixed utility contribution of €100 per month to cover gas, electricity, bins, tv, internet etc. 

Available for a minimum of 6 months or longer.

The room will have full access to a large bathroom with w.c., w.h.b., bath and separate pumped shower unit on the 1st floor and another toilet on the ground floor (w.c. and w.h.b.).

Fully furnished and move-in ready, with storage and a peaceful atmosphere ideal for both work and rest.

1 friendly professional living in the house. 

This is a well-maintained detached family home offering space, privacy and a genuinely calm and relaxed living environment. 

