1 double bedroom is currently available. 

The house offers well-proportioned living accommodation which comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a large living room, a fully equipped kitchen with dining area, four spacious bedrooms, a shared bathroom with a bath and a shower, and a WC. Externally, the property benefits from a generously-sized private rear garden.

The area is well served by public transport, with the LUAS and multiple bus stops just a short distance away, easy access to the N7and M50.

