Sharing with the owner, a teacher in his 30s studying part-time also. Will be busy during the week with work and study so would appreciate a quiet house.

Great amenities nearby - Tesco, Aldi, Gym, takeaways just across the road. 2 bus corridors just outisde the apartment - 122, 38, 38A, 39, 39A, 70. Can walk to Phoenix Park in 10 mins, Stoneybatter in 15 mins, Phibsboro 15 mins.

