','Sunday Evening to Friday Morning*** 

Bright and spacious double room available in a modern A-rated new-build home in Keepers Lock Park, Clonburris.
 
The room is available from Sunday evening to Friday morning and may particularly appeal to an individual seeking comfortable weekday accommodation close to excellent transport links. The property offers a quiet residential setting, exclusive use of the main bathroom, and easy access to Dublin city centre via Clondalkin/Fonthill Station.
 
The room is fully furnished with a double bed, bedside tables, and a large fitted wardrobe, offering excellent storage space.
 
What''s Included
- Fully furnished double bedroom
- Exclusive use of main bathroom
- Parking space included
- High-speed broadband
- Modern A-rated energy-efficient home
- Quiet residential development
- Canal walkway and greenway nearby
- 5-minute walk to Clondalkin/Fonthill Station
- 20-minute walk to The Mill Shopping Centre
- 10-minute drive to Liffey Valley Shopping Centre
','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 9.61}}',1,750);
