Are you in Dublin during the week but returning home at weekends? 
A beautiful double room available in a newly renovated 3 bedroom house. Ideal for someone who lives outside Dublin but needs a bed during the week, without paying Dublin rent for seven nights a week. 
The house is excellently situated on a quiet green in Cabra with on street parking. 

The house has been fully insulated, has new triple glazed windows,  and comprises of a sitting room, kitchen, bathroom, and 3 bedrooms. 
The double room is 190  per week, including all bills  . 

There is a beautiful big south facing garden to the rear of the house, which gets the sun all day long. The house is also just a stones throw from the great amenity that is the Pheonix Park. 


Available to move in on the 17th of September or earlier if needed.
Long or short-term lease available. 
500 euro deposit.
I have 2 cats, so I''m looking for a cat friendly person.

Th','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 3.32}}',1,NULL);
