A bed is available for one GIRL in a twin bedroom, shared with another GIRL already living in the apartment, in a bright penthouse apartment in the heart of Dublin City Centre.

The apartment:

A spacious penthouse with loads of natural light and great views over the city. One of the nicest features is the long balcony running along the apartment, giving the place a bright, open feel.

The apartment has a fully equipped kitchen, comfortable shared living space and is shared by a friendly, international household.

The room:

This is a twin bedroom for two people. One girl is already living in the room and we''re looking for another girl to take the second bed.

The room is furnished and bright, with everything needed to move in and make yourself at home.

