'EUR',700,NULL,'2026-09-10',NULL,2,1,'Male / Female',1,'Sep 17th, 2026','Shared Bathroom','Dublin Host Families are proud to offer a bedroom in this lovely home located only 9 kilometres from Dublin City Centre.

Ideally situated close to TU Dublin (Tallaght), Tallaght Hospital, The Square Shopping Centre and only a short stroll to several bus routes linking to Dublin City Centre and beyond (route number 49 / 65B / S6 / S8 / SD3 / SD4).

All household bills are included (gas, electric, cable, wifi, water)
	
The Host will seek a small security deposit against breakages that is refunded when leaving the house (€100)

The rate for the room is €700 per month (single) and it is paid every month in advance.

The minimum stay is 3 months and would be available for up to 6 months.

Please e mail to check availability or to arrange a visit.','Single Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 10.51}}',1,NULL);
