Large, bright attic bedroom available in a quiet, owner-occupied home in a settled residential area close to Tallaght Hospital.

This accommodation is intentionally set up for someone who values proper rest, privacy, and a calm living environment — ideal for hospital staff, professionals on placement, or anyone working long or irregular hours who wants a simple, low-stress place to come home to.

The household is peaceful and respectful, with clear expectations and no parties or social house-sharing. Best suited to someone who is busy with work and out of the house much of the day, and who appreciates a predictable, well-run home.

Accommodation includes:
- Spacious, bright attic bedroom
- Shared bathroom
- Warm, well-insulated space with good temperature control
- Quiet area with minimal outside noise
- Fixed all-in monthly cost — no surprises

Practical details:
- Owner-occupied home
