About the House & Room:
We are offering one large, bright single room with plenty of storage space and a single bed. Our home is a very clean, quiet, and respectful family house with a lovely garden, a fully equipped kitchen, and 3 bathrooms. 
We also have a very friendly family dog. 
Located in a lovely, safe, and peaceful neighborhood in Dublin 15.

