 Summary:
Ideally looking for 2 or 3 people (friends, relatives) who would like to share together a basic but clean and friendly house.
Available: 2 rooms with 3 beds and private toilet.
Bathroom and kitchen is shared with one more person.
LOCATION IS EXCELLENT!

Price:
For 2 people: 156/wk (675/m) per person
For 3 people: 105/wk (450/m) per person

THE ROOMS:
1. A spacious, clean twin room with lots of storage space, fridge freezer, microwave and kettle for convenience. 
2. Small lovely room with bed, hangers, underbed storage, table and chair.

Common Area:
Bathroom with toilet and shower.
Kitchen with 4 hobs, separate grill and oven. Kettle. Fridges, Freezer. New Washing Machine.

Air purifier and dehumidifiers in the house to prevent mould and drying clothes efficiently and fast.

Small garden.

Quiet house, friendly neighbourhood. Excellent location, easy access to the City Centre.

There are pet rabbits, so animal lovers are most welcome!

Tesco, Lidl, SuperValu, Local Centra, ','Double & Twin Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 4.07}}',1,NULL);
