 SINGLE ROOM WITH DOUBLE BED FOR RENT – PHIBSBOROUGH, DUBLIN 7

 Available from OCTOBER 5th to NOVEMBER 1st

SHORT-TERM LET

 PRICE:
 €600 / 4 weeks + bills (around €40 – €50)

