other females who enjoy their own activities, as well as open to a shared household. The double room is front facing to a quiet cul-de-sac street. Local park is Corkagh Park, Clondalkin at the end of the street with access to Dublin bus on the main road for easy access to Clondalkin village, the Mill Shopping Centre and Dublin city as well as national motorways. All transport links and shopping are within walking distance. 
Please allow €100-175 for bills, waste removal, gas, electricity and broadband, this will vary by time of year. One months rent and one months deposit.
Looking for a person to share with me and another girl, for a year let minimum, non-smoker, no pets, friendly and professional.','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 10.35}}',1,NULL);
