€525 per month + utilities | Available immediately

Double room available in a spacious shared house in Walkinstown, Dublin 12, close to Crumlin Village, Drimnagh and Crumlin Children’s Hospital.

The room is a bright converted attic room with a double bed, wardrobe and two large Velux windows. The room is open to the stairs and does not have an internal door.

The house has a kitchen, sitting room and separate dining/living room, with plenty of shared space. Two driveway parking spaces are available, plus plenty of free on-street parking.

Good transport links, with S4, 27, 56A, 77A, 77N, 125, 150 and 151 nearby, and Lucas Red Line approx 1km away.

You’ll be sharing with one female and a couple. We’re looking for someone in their 30s, who is clean and respectful.

Rent: €525/month + utilities
Deposit: €525
Available: Immediately
Long-term preferred

There is a cat associated with the house who occasionally comes indoors, so the house may not suit','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 4.87}}',1,NULL);
