September 26th to November 26th

Beautiful views, must be seen to fully appreciate :) Looking for a tidy & clean person to share a home with.

You will share a bathroom with two other tenants.

Close to everything:
- bus stop H1, H2, 102 to airport 5 minutes from the house. Airport approx 1 hr by bus
- 40 mins to city centre on the bus
- 3 Dart stations all within 10 mins drive or cycle
