The single room offers comfortable accommodation at a rate of €165 per week, with a deposit of €660.

The room is fully furnished with a single bed and provides a bright and welcoming living space.

Included in the property is high-speed broadband (Vodafone Business 500MB), regular cleaning services, and access to waste disposal facilities.

Electricity is shared among housemates for ease and fairness.

The house is not owner-occupied, giving you the freedom to make it feel like home.

We offer flexible stay options with a minimum of 6 months (longer stays are welcome). Room is available for immediate entry.

Location and Amenities:
