Single Room Available for Student – Sutton, Dublin 13

Comfortable single room available for a student in a family home in Sutton, Dublin 13. The room is furnished and includes a desk and chair, providing a suitable space for studying.

The room is available from Sunday evening to Friday during the college week. Although the room is not available for staying in at weekends, you are welcome to leave all of your belongings in the room, so there is no need to pack up each week.

You would be sharing our home with a family of four and one small, friendly dog. The bathroom is shared with the family.

The house is very well located for public transport:

Bayside DART Station – approximately 4 minutes'' walk
Bus stops – approximately 5 minutes'' walk
Easy access to Dublin city centre by DART or bus

The accommodation includes:

Private single bedroom
Desk and chair for studying
Sunday evening to Friday accommodation
Room remains yours, so belongings ','Single Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 9.74}}',1,NULL);
