€185 per week, or €800 per month. €370 deposit required. All bills included, 

please message about yourself and why this short term move is suitable for you.

This is a lovely small single room with plenty of storage, ideal for a person studying and working in Dublin. The shared bathroom has an electric shower. The kitchen dining has allocated cupboards for tenants and an additional fridge freezer for food. All bills included. 
There is a pleasant back garden, This area is settled and quiet, and parking is available.
looking for females only to share with other females already in house.

This is a great location in Dublin 18, close to bus stops for commuting to Dublin City, and less than a 30-minute walk to the LUAS stop. Restaurants, cafes, pharmacies, etc, are all within walking distance. Dundrum Town Centre is about 2.5 km away, or a 15-minute bus ride. Dublin City centre is about 50 minutes away by public transport.
* PLEASE NOTE','Single Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 8.71}}',1,NULL);
