VE", "name": "Microwave"}, {"key": "WHEELCHAIR_ACCESS", "name": "Wheelchair Access"}, {"key": "INTERNET", "name": "Internet"}, {"key": "GARDEN_PATIO_BALCONY", "name": "Garden / Patio / Balcony"}], "betterBest": false}','2026-09-10T02:45:32.955513+00:00','2026-09-10T03:32:09.534404+00:00',0,2,'daft','EUR',1434,331,'2026-09-02',NULL,7,1,'Male / Female',0,'Immediately','En-suite','Private en-suite room available for academic-year, full-year or Semester 1 bookings. For Semester 1, the room is available from September to December at €346.80 per week, plus a €20 weekly service charge.

The room measures approximately 13–14m². It includes a double bed with built-in storage, wardrobe, shelving, study desk and chair, USB charging points, full-length mirror and a private en-suite bathroom.

The room forms part of an eight-bedroom apartment, with a fully equipped kitchen, dining area and comfortable living space shared with seven other students. Each apartment also has its own washing machine and dryer.

The residence offers 24/7 staff and security, high-speed Wi-Fi, a fully equipped gym, private study rooms and booths, a games area, TV lounge, secure cycle storage and regular resident events.

Convenient city-centre location within walking distance of Trinity College and well connected by Luas to TU Dublin and other colleges.

The €20 weekly service charge covers elect','Single Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 0.74}}',1,NULL);
