Each twin bedroom contains two beds and a private en-suite bathroom. The rooms are located within two- or three-bedroom apartments, with a shared kitchen and living area.

This is a professionally managed student residence in Dublin 8, well located for students attending Trinity College Dublin, RCSI, TU Dublin and UCD. The gated campus has 24-hour security, a fitness room, library access and free underground bicycle and car parking.

Each apartment has a furnished living and dining area, controllable heating and a fully equipped kitchen, including an oven, hob, microwave, fridge/freezer, toaster and kettle. There is also an on-site maintenance team and laundry facilities costing €4.50 per wash and €3 per dry.

Payment is required in full before ','Twin Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 2.14}}',1,NULL);
