Hey there!
I’ve got a lovely single room available in a cosy, owner-occupied house just a short 10-minute stroll from Dublin City University (DCU) and 25-minute walk from St Pat''s college. You’ll be sharing the house with just one other (me!), so it’s quiet and relaxed—perfect for a student.
Includes:
· Bright, fully furnished single room with a desk, ample wardrobe space and storage bed
· Your own private downstairs bathroom
· Fast Wi-Fi and all bills included
· Shared kitchen and living space
· Large back garden
· Off street parking available
· Friendly, respectful atmosphere
The house is in a safe, convenient area with shops, cafes, and bus routes nearby. 

If you’re looking for a relaxed place to study, this could be the spot for you.

Rent: €700 per month
Deposit: €700
Available from: 6th September 

If you’re interested or want to pop by for a viewing, just drop me a message!','Single Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 4.59}}',1,NULL);
