The house is spacious with a kitchen, two separate living rooms downstairs, a bathroom, four bedrooms, a garage and both a front and back south-facing garden.

The room has been newly painted and carpeted, and includes a comfortable double bed, desk, office chair, adjustable clothes rail and chest of drawers, with a great view of the backgarden. 

The kitchen, bathroom and other living spaces are all shared with a couple in their early 30s who frequently . 

Bills are included (WiFi, electricity, heating, bins) with free on-street parking available directly outside the property. 

The location is one of the best parts of the house. It is close to St. Anne’s Park and Clontarf seafront, within easy reach of Dublin city centre, with shops, restaurants, cafés and public transport nearby.

