Comfortable single bedroom in a clean, modern and welcoming owner-occupied home, shared with a young couple. Located close to local colleges, amenities and excellent public transport links.

This is a hosted, digs-style arrangement rather than a traditional house share. You will have your own private bedroom, with breakfast and an evening meal provided Monday–Friday. We are looking for someone who is happy to be part of a quiet, respectful household and understands that this is our home, rather than a shared rental property.

The house offers a peaceful environment, ideal for studying. The sitting room is our private living space, while the kitchen and bathroom are shared household areas.

We would particularly welcome a female student, including international students, looking for a safe, quiet and friendly home while studying in Dublin.

No visitors or overnight guests.

Access to the coffee machine is also included.

€255 per week, i','Single Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 3.69}}',1,NULL);
