2,'Male / Female / +1 Person',0,'Immediately','En-suite','House Share – Luttrellstown Gate, Porterstown, Dublin 15

Multiple rooms for rent in an exceptional 4 bedroom house - bright, spacious, energy-efficient accommodation, perfect for somoene seeking high-quality rental in a peaceful yet well-connected location.

All tenants have full access to the property''s shared spaces: a fully equipped kitchen, a garden room, and a garden/patio — ideal for cooking, relaxing, or working from home outside of your private room.

Twin room with shared bathroom - €650 each 2 persons sharing or €1100 if taken wholly by one person

Twin room with ensuite  - €750 each 2 persons sharing or €1300 if taken wholly by one person.

Both rooms have 2 single beds in each of the rooms.

Rent includes internet, bin and communal spaces/ bathrooms cleaning. Electricity bill to be shared between the tenants (A rated house).

This is a serviced property. Professional cleaners come in bi-weekly to clean all communal areas, including the kitchen, garden room, and shared bath','Twin Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 10.39}}',1,NULL);
