ULL,4,1,'Female',1,'Immediately','Shared Bathroom','5 DAY RENTAL – FEMALE ONLY (THIS IS A SUNDAY –FRIDAY RENTAL FOR STUDENTS) 

Single room with shared bathroom available in a family home in Stillorgan. This is a Sunday-Friday rental. Street parking is available outside the house.
Rent is €200 per week payable by Revolut or bank transfer with an €800 deposit payable upfront. This includes gas, electricity, WiFi and all other bills.
The room contains a single bed, desk and chair, built-in wardrobe and bedside locker. The house is warm and well-insulated and was modernised and redecorated in 2021. Upstairs there is an ensuite master bedroom, three other bedrooms and a family bathroom. Downstairs there is an open/plan kitchen dining room, a sitting room, downstairs toilet and TV/family room.  There is a garden with mature trees to the front of the house and a rear garden with garden office and outside dining area. There is also secure, covered bike storage at the side of the house.
The house is located in a quiet leafy estate just over 5 m','Single Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 7.77}}',1,NULL);
