The fully furnished kitchen and living area is shared with five other residents and includes integrated appliances, a dining area, comfortable seating and a TV.

Available on a 41-week contract at €295 per week. The advertised price includes all bills and high-speed Wi-Fi.

Residents also have access to an on-site gym and fitness studio, study spaces, communal lounges, games and TV areas, a cinema room, roof terrace, landscaped garden and secure bicycle storage. The residence benefits from secure key-fob entry and 24-hour CCTV and is well connected to Dublin city centre by bus.','Single Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 5.56}}',1,NULL);
