"name": "Alarm"}, {"key": "WASHING_MACHINE", "name": "Washing Machine"}, {"key": "DRYER", "name": "Dryer"}, {"key": "MICROWAVE", "name": "Microwave"}, {"key": "INTERNET", "name": "Internet"}, {"key": "GARDEN_PATIO_BALCONY", "name": "Garden / Patio / Balcony"}], "betterBest": false}','2026-09-10T02:45:32.955513+00:00','2026-09-10T03:32:09.534404+00:00',0,2,'daft','EUR',693,NULL,'2026-09-08',NULL,1,1,'Male / Female / +1 Person',0,'Immediately','Shared Bathroom','Twin Room Available – Dublin 7 | Just 5 Minutes'' Walk to Dublin City Centre

This bright and spacious twin room is located in the heart of Dublin 7, just a 5-minute walk from Dublin City Centre. The house features modern interiors, lovely décor, and a spacious shared kitchen, creating a comfortable and welcoming place to call home.

The twin room is fully furnished with two single beds, two desks, and two wardrobes, offering plenty of natural light and storage space. Both beds are available from the same date, making this an excellent option for two people moving together or for individual bookings. The room is suitable for any gender.

The house has everything you need for a comfortable stay, with plenty of space to work, relax, and enjoy city living. You''ll have all the modern conveniences at your fingertips, while being only moments away from shops, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, and excellent public transport. There is also a designated outdoor smoking area.

Living here means s','Twin Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 1.26}}',1,NULL);
