** Viewings will take place on Tuesday - Thursday 14th - 16th of July inclusive. Please email to secure your viewing time. 

This beautiful period home is located in one of the most sought-after spots in South Dublin, long admired for its access to the sea at Seapoint, the restaurants and boutiques of Blackrock, Monkstown, Dun Laoghaire and Sandycove, in addition to top transport links, cafes and parks.

*** Whether it’s
o unwinding with a quick dip in the nearby saunas and pools, 
o sunny Saturdays filled with leisurely strolls along the seafront, 
o coffee at the numerous nearby chic cafes, 
o playing tennis / sailing at the local clubs 
