lidl + bus stop is three minutes around the corner .
The main shopping area is 15 minutes away by foot.
There are parks, a gym with swimming pool, cafes, shops, library and college just in easy walking distance. 
Liffey valley retail park is 10 minutes away by public transport.

The utility bills, cable tv, high speed WiFi, bedlinen supplied and laundered are included in the monthly rent €750.
There is also a refundable security deposit of €750.
Which is redeemable at the end of the contract term,once all is in order.
