This bright and comfortable twin room is located on the second floor of a peaceful house in The Rise, Dublin. Fully furnished and designed for comfortable shared living, the room offers a modern and welcoming atmosphere with plenty of natural light.

The property includes high-speed Wi-Fi, making it ideal for online classes, remote work, meetings, or gaming. Every room comes with a desk and dedicated workspace with convenient power outlets. Residents also have access to a fully equipped shared kitchen, a designated laundry area with a washing machine and dryer, and an outdoor smoking space.

