We’re looking for a responsible and considerate person who values a relaxed, respectful home environment to fill the room. It’s the kind of place where everyone does their part, keeps things tidy, and treats each other with respect.

Non smoker, not a party house.

Please tell us a bit of about yourself in your reply, the current housemates work varied schedules, so let us know now what your day to day is like.

DETAILS
The room is cosy, but with lots of built in storage,  bathroom shared with two others.

The house has a small sitting room and large kitchen with mod cons, off street parking and outdoor bike storage.

The E1, E2, S8 and 114  buses serve stops close by and offer links to both the dart and green luas.

Dunnes, Lidl and Supervalu are a 15-20 minute walk from the house, and Stillorgan shopping centre and Blackrock village are 30-35 minut','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 8.95}}',1,NULL);
