Exceptional Student Accommodation Available

We are delighted to offer a spacious and beautifully presented double room in a large, peaceful home — ideal for a student seeking a comfortable and supportive living environment.

The house is owner-occupied by a warm and welcoming female homeowner and shared with a friendly chihuahua, adding a lovely sense of companionship to the home.

The bright and airy bedroom features wooden floors, generous fitted wardrobes, and plenty of storage space for study materials and personal belongings. It also includes a comfortable double bed and a dedicated study desk, creating the perfect setting for focused academic work.

You will also enjoy:

Your own fridge and designated kitchen space
Access to a private upstairs sitting room, ideal for relaxing or entertaining friends
A calm and respectful household atmosphere

Conveniently located just a short walk from the Law Socie','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 2.15}}',1,NULL);
