g area , bathroom , front and back garden. Northway estate is set in a fantastic location within walking distance of Finglas Village, Glasnevin Avenue and 1.5 km from the botanic gardens. Located a short drive from the Charlestown Shopping, Omniplex Cinemas and the City Centre is just a 15 minute journey. There are multiple bus services to the city centre, hospitals, and airport. Please respond using the email option on the advertisement as we are not accepting calls on this listing. Ideally you will include some details about yourself in a short response to the ad.','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 6.72}}',1,NULL);
