The room has its own private ensuite bathroom, a king size bed, large mirrored wardrobe, desk and office chair.

Rent: €975 per month. Only available for one single person.

Bills: WiFi, gas and electricity are shared separately and split fairly based on actual bills.

Parking: One dedicated off-street parking space included.

Transport & Amenities:

4 minute walk to 208 bus into the city center (13 minutes). 

36 mins via 210 to Eastgate, Little Island.

Next to District gym - 8 minute walk. 

Available: 27th September.

