WMwMmM5NGM3M2I0OWNlZTc5NjEwOC5qcGcifQ==?signature=a81bd00de09a91e6b548dfcf15ee109636c78ae46bc6f7a82a160d12da4be3f1"], "rectangleLogo": "https://media.daft.ie/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJtZWRpYW1hc3Rlci1zM2V1IiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7ImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSIsImhlaWdodCI6ODB9fSwia2V5IjoiNlwvNlwvNjY4ZmE0MjU2ZDg5MDBlNDcwMDk3Y2M5MzlkYmU5YWVfc3RhbmRhcmQucG5nIn0=?signature=014fcd5036904f8d8848585db7613363174aff6b5eb2e8f33c703d1b57471962"}, "state": "PUBLISHED", "premierPartner": false, "betterBest": false}','2026-09-10T04:00:32.806894+00:00','2026-09-10T18:41:42.481794+00:00',1,0,'daft','EUR',900,NULL,'2026-09-10',NULL,4,4,'Male / Female',0,'Immediately','Shared Bathroom','Sherry FitzGerald Lettings are delighted to bring this sparkling four bedroom home to the rental market.

Located off the Bishopstown Road, this Woodbrook Avenue house is within walking distance of schools, sports clubs, restaurants, shopping centres and hospitals.

Accomodation in this much upgraded home includes a practical kitchen supported by a well equipped utility room with a washing machine and dryer as well as an extra fridge / freezer.

Also to the sunny rear of the house there is a cosy lounge and a conservatory. 

The ground floor also provides a double bedroom and a bathroom with an electric shower.

Upstairs, there are three further double bedrooms and another bathroom with shower.

Externally, the front completely paved - allowing plenty of off street parking while to the rear, there are split level patio''s that benefit hugely from the southern sun.

If you are in the market for a nice clean four bed in Bishopstown, this Woodbrook house will be hard to beat.

Please visit','Double Room','cork','{"distances_km": {"centre": 4.41}}',1,NULL);
