_PATIO_BALCONY", "name": "Garden / Patio / Balcony"}], "betterBest": false}','2026-09-10T04:00:32.806894+00:00','2026-09-10T18:41:42.481794+00:00',1,0,'daft','EUR',900,NULL,'2026-09-09',NULL,2,1,'Female',1,'Oct 1st, 2026','En-suite','Its a lovely 3 bed house within walking distance of tesco (wilton shopping centre), dunnes, cuh, aldi & lidl. There is also a gym within 10 mins walk.

The house was refurbished a few years ago when we bought it. We have a nice garden with a picnic bench and a decent sized shed. We also have a working fireplace and will have fires going in the winter.

We are a couple in our mid-late 30s looking for a chill and tidy tennant. We also have an 8 month old Samoyed puppy who is incredibly friendly and house trained.

