* Eden is a big modern and quiet housing estate with wonderful environment and management. Its 5-10mins drive to town and 10mins walk to Mahon point. Bus stop is just out of the gate. The occupant will have private car space at ungrounded parking. And there are plenty visiting parking spaces in public car park area outside the apartment complex. Also there is a big supermarket and a big pharmacy next to the gate. 

*This apartment is on the third floor with breath taking views. Big gardens at both sides of the building. 5 big floor to celling double glass windows fill the living area with light and keep whole apartment very warm. Property is fully furnished with high quality furnitures. 

