Secure gated complex!!! 
Fully refurbished home! 
Very sought after location as minutes walking to Mahon Point shopping centre, the Mater Private Hospital and City Gate. Cork International Airport is 15 min away, N40 road network and Jack Lynch tunnel are easily accessible. Easy access to buses to downtown.  Looking for friendly, respectful-non smoking, no party tenants as it''s a family neighborhood. Duplex is spacious with big bedrooms and double beds. There is 1 room to let, with a shared bathroom with another tenant( there is also a toilet downstairs). Plenty of storage space as build in huge wardrobes. There is a massive kitchen area and separate dining area. Living room with fireplace and sunroom leads to Balcony. Beautiful walk/run/cycle path to Blackrock Castle or Rochestown with charming estuary views. 
Pets not allowed. 
1 months rent and 1 months deposit required in advance. 
Please send a detailed summary of yourself- as they will be answered.','Double Room','cork','{"distances_km": {"centre": 5.43}}',1,NULL);
