',1,0,'daft','EUR',950,NULL,'2026-09-07',NULL,4,1,'Male / Female / +1 Person',1,'Oct 4th, 2026','Shared Bathroom','Very important this is not a party home. 

Couples accepted at additional cost (+200 per month)

Large double room available from the 4th Oct - possibly sooner. High end luxury mattresses and high-quality furniture with lots of storage. There is also a TV and Sky box with all sky packages in rooms and sitting room. Large wardrobe and storage space. Gas central heating and gas fire place. Solid wood flooring. Blackout blinds and curtains. Desk and chair.

This is a very clean and tidy kept house, the property is finished to a very high standard with all luxury modern cons,

no smoking and no pets, 

Sky Q box with Sky sports in sitting room,

high speed broadband, bins, and
house cleaned every two weeks by professional cleaners which is all included in the rent

We split the ESB and GAS between us every 2 months when new bill comes in.

 Shared bathroom has a Jacuzzi bath with a choice of two showers, either a pumped or electric shower. Downstairs communal toilet as well.

It''s a nice q','Double Room','cork','{"distances_km": {"centre": 4.0}}',1,NULL);
