R',1150,NULL,'2026-09-07',NULL,7,1,'Male / Female',0,'Immediately','En-suite','We are delighted to present a house share available now in an elegant Victorian house.

About the location:

University Lodge is located right across from the main gates of UCC on the Western Road.
Cork City Centre is a convenient 10 minute walk from University Lodge.
Fitzgerald Park is a scenic green space which is right around the corner.

**Those who are familiar with Cork will know that this is a superb location**

About University Lodge:
House has been modernized this year with new appliances. 
Shared modern kitchen and living space.
There is an awesome separate room designed as a coffee station with a kitchenette.
Brand new comfortable double beds available.
High speed internet with wifi coverage reaching every room.
Cable TV.
Off-street parking available on request along with bike storage.
cleaning service included.
Non smoking.


Rental agreement required along with 1 month''s deposit.
