A newly renovated, bright and modern studio-style accommodation, available from the last week of September.

The accommodation is attached to our family home and has its own private entrance, making it ideal for someone looking for their own private living and sleeping space. It is suitable for one lodger only.

The studio is bright and welcoming, with a nice large window providing plenty of natural light.

Renovation works will be completed within the next two weeks. The accommodation is still available to view upon request during the renovation period, so prospective lodgers are welcome to arrange a viewing.

The studio and kitchenette will come fully equipped, 

The downstairs bathroom and utility room are shared with the family home, including use of the washing machine and dryer.

Features:

Newly renovated studio-style accommodation
Large window providing plenty of natural light
Own ','Double Room','limerick','{"distances_km": {"centre": 2.26}}',1,NULL);
