The house is in a quiet residential setting, within easy walking distance of Grand Canal Dock, the Docklands, Aviva Stadium, 3Arena, Dunnes (Point Square Shopping Center) and Dublin city centre. Ringsend Village is also just a short walk away, with cafés, shops, pubs and other local amenities nearby.

The room is bright, quiet and private, with good storage and plenty of natural light. The house has a fully equipped kitchen, comfortable shared living area and two bathrooms.
Excellent transport links, with The Point Luas stop just a 7-minute walk away and Grand Canal Dock DART Station around 16 minutes away. Several Dublin Bus routes are also nearby, making it easy to get around the city. On-street parking is available locally.

Rent is €1,250 & 1350 per month, with bills shared separately.

I’m looking for a tidy, respectful tenant to share the ','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 2.13}}',1,NULL);
