Rent: 850 Euros/Month (Utilities Included)

Key Features:

Spacious and New: This duplex unit features brand-new furniture and a brand-new mattress in your room, ensuring a fresh and comfortable living experience.

Utilities Included: The rent covers all utilities, including broadband and electricity, providing hassle-free living with no extra costs.

Prime Location: Located within walking distance of the coast, enjoy beautiful coastal walking routes and easy access to numerous transport options.

Transport Links: Shankill Dart Station is just 1km away, offering easy access to the city centre in 30 minutes. Several bus routes are a 3-5 minute walk away, and the Brides Glen Luas stop is a 10-minute cycle from the property.

Convenient Amenities: Lidl is a 5-minute walk, and Tesco Express in Shankill village','Single Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 15.1}}',1,NULL);
