93+00:00',1,0,'daft','EUR',1250,NULL,'2026-09-07',NULL,1,1,'Male / Female',0,'Immediately','Shared Bathroom','[Please note]: This is NOT for couples or friends sharing one room. 

Hello everybody! Double room available in Ballsbridge court from the beginning of May. 

The location is great if your office/university is located in Dublin 4. 5 mins walk to Meta office and 10 mins walk to local amenities such as Tesco, Avoca, Centra, HorseShow House, gym etc.

About the Room:
Your room has a queen size bed and it is south-facing! Which means plenty of sunlight. A spacious wardrobe is also included. It is also possible to fit in a small-medium sized desk if you are planning to  for few days in a week. 

About the Flat:
The flat includes a big living room, fully equipped kitchen, bathroom (with instant shower) and a balcony which has great view.
The laundry/storage room is equipped with dryer and washer. 

Extra Info regarding the costs:
- Deposit: 1500 
- Bill will include Wifi: 23.5/month, and electricity will be split between us.  

Just a few Friendly Notes : )
