Double room in a 2-bedroom apartment available at Neptune Apartments at Honeypark. 
There are two possible arrangements:
1 ensuite double bedroom with a bathroom inside
1 double room with a bathroom opposite the room but that will be your own. 
5 mins walk to a big Tesco, Costa, Boots, bus stop and several eateries and cafés. 1 minute walking distance from a park with a playground and pond. 20 mins walking distance to Dun Laoghaire city centre.

Friendly neighbourhood. Lots of facilities in the building like a lift, a gym, a playground in the centre of the building. 
There''s events now and then (like movie nights) with free pizza, drinks and icecream.
