- Clondalkin village is approximately 15 minutes away with the Dublin bus, there you will find a broader range of amenities like restaurants, pubs, barbers, etc...
- price includes all bills. 
- one month deposit required.
- references desirable
- please apply only if you are looking for an accommodation for 6 months or longer.
- ID required (to show that you are legally entitled to study/work/resid','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 11.06}}',1,NULL);
