Key Features:
-	Good size double bedroom with single bed, built in wardrobe space and a desk. 
-	Own spacious bathroom with bath/shower, basin, toilet and towel rack
-	Linen etc provided
-	Rent includes Wi-Fi, waste management and management fees. Gas and electricity bills are shared with other student
-	Coded entry to apartment building and underground car park

Location and Transport:
-	Stepaside: restaurants, cafes, gym, medical center, local and grocery stores all within walking distance
-	Dundrum Town Centre is easily accessible, approx. 5-10 mins by car
-	Luas: 10 mins to Glencairn Luas stop
-	Bus: route 47, 44 and 114 stops within walking distance
-	Bike: 19 mins to UCD by bike

Sharing with one female first year student. Looking for someone tidy and easy going. Apply in ','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 9.6}}',1,NULL);
