A beautiful large Bedroom En-Suite to rent within a spacious owner-occupied house in the estate of Laraghcon, Lucan. 
Suitable for a Student or a Teacher /professional.  The house has two living rooms & conservatory along with a large kitchen/dining room & sunny rear garden with patio furniture. Parking space at front driveway.  Situated in a quiet area, facing a large Green park, ideal for walking and running.  10 minutes walking distance from Lucan village and all bus routes.','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 13.16}}',1,NULL);
