Looking for tenant (male or female) to share with another gentleman (professional working on sales) who is currently living in the apartment. Room available for 1 year or more, available from 1/Sep/2026.

Room Tour video: https://youtube.com/shorts/Gwq7Lx54jW4?feature=share

The apartment is in very good location, walking distance to:
- Bus Stops: 1~2 mins
- Spencer Dock Luas Stop: 4 mins
- Docklands Train Station: 4 mins
- Centra, Tesco: 5~6 mins
- Mayor Square (many restraunts, cafe, shops): 9 mins
- Lidl, Aldi: 11 mins

Please email to arrange a viewing time you prefer, also includes a brief introduction about yourself, when do you plan to move in, how long would you stay etc.','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 1.63}}',1,NULL);
