": "Microwave"}, {"key": "INTERNET", "name": "Internet"}, {"key": "SERVICED_PROPERTY", "name": "Serviced Property"}], "betterBest": false}','2026-09-10T04:02:28.357574+00:00','2026-09-10T18:43:35.311093+00:00',1,0,'daft','EUR',1500,NULL,'2026-09-08',NULL,1,1,'Male / Female',1,'Oct 1st, 2026','En-suite','Spacious double room available in a beautifully presented 130 sqm, 3-bedroom townhouse. This room benefits from its own private  bathroom with shower.

The third bedroom is kept free as a guest room/office and is not part of the rental, so it won''t be occupied - just you and one other housemate sharing the space.

All bills are included in the rent, so no surprises. The property is professionally cleaned every two weeks.

Fantastic location: three cafes within 100 metres, The Villager pub just around the corner, plus a pharmacy next door and a Spar right beside it - everything you need on your doorstep.

