 Location
- Walking distance to OpenAI, Google,  TikTok, HubSpot, Salesforce, Stripe, Meta, and other major tech offices
- 2–3 min walk to bus stops; 5–10 min walk to Grand Canal Dock DART station
- Surrounded by cafés, restaurants and bars
- Fresh, Spar and Tesco nearby
- Short walk to Ballsbridge, Sandymount and the city centre
- Scenic walks along the canal and docklands

 The Room
- Spacious double room with three layers of electric blinds (including blackout) — wake up to natural light at the touch of a button
- Queen bed (W150 × L200) with awar','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 1.53}}',1,NULL);
