The bedroom is furnished with a double bed, desk, office chair and good storage and has its own en-suite shower room.

The apartment has a large, bright open-plan living, dining and kitchen area with extensive windows and access to a private balcony. The kitchen is fully equipped, with a new oven, hob, dishwasher and microwave installed in 2025, together with fridge/freezer, washing machine and tumble dryer.

The apartment was fully repainted in 2025 and is furnished throughout.

There will be just two occupants in the apartment in total. 

Castleforbes Square is a secure and well-maintained development within easy walking distance of the IFSC, Spencer Dock, Three Arena and Dublin city centre, with the LUAS and numerous bus services nearby.

Rent: €1,300 per month
Deposit: €1,300
Available: Immediately
