This is an owner-occupied home with a non-smoking, no-vaping, no-pets and shoes-off policy.

The house has a fully equipped kitchen, living room and washing machine, all available for use. High-speed internet is included, while utility bills are shared separately.

A second, smaller bedroom is also available at a different rental rate.

The house is just a 5-minute walk from Glencairn Luas stop, with convenient access to nearby bus routes and excellent transport links to RCSI University, UCD and Trinity College.

If you are interested, please get in touch with a little information about yourself.','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 9.35}}',1,1300);
