R',900,NULL,'2026-09-03',NULL,1,2,'Male / Female',0,'Oct 1st, 2026','En-suite','2 spacious double bedrooms available to rent in a large well maintained house. Available from 1st October 2026.

Bedroom 1: Double Bedroom with ensuite bathroom EUR1,000/month
Bedroom 2: Double Bedroom EUR900/month

Utilities/bills are not included.

The third bedroom is currently occupied by a male professional in his mid 30s. 

The house itself has plenty of shared living space, including a large kitchen, 2 living rooms, 2 separate bathrooms (in addition to an ensuite) and a home office. These rentals would suit quiet tenants who are respectful of others. 

This is a safe and quiet area which is well served with transport links (9, 77a, 27 bus routes – short walk away, M50 access – 5 mins drive, Red Luas line – 20 minutes walk). 

There are several supermarkets, local shops and pubs located within a short walking distance.

Please send a short covering email and we will get in touch to arrange a viewing (evenings and weekends only).','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 5.94}}',1,NULL);
