An amazing location just over 2km from the city centre in a leafy community between Phibsborough and Glasnevin.

City living at its best with numerous cafes, restaurants, bars, supermarkets and shops close by.

All bills are included, i.e., electricity, super-fast Wi-Fi, refuse collection, cleaning, Sky & Netflix streaming services. Cleaning every two weeks. The price includes everything. 

Walking distance to buses, Luas and Drumcondra train station. 

Heat recovery systems provide a continuous fresh clean filtered air supply for a dust and allergy free environment for a healthier standard of living.

Flexible license terms with 12 months or longer agreements but only one month''s notice is required if your circumstances change. 

All suites have access Julliet Double Doors and all apartments have their own balcony with outdoor seating.
 
Car parking (extra fee) and storage for bicycles available.

Featur','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 2.29}}',1,NULL);
