The house: Modern, well-furnished, bright, spacious, warm, tons of storage in both the kitchen and throughout. Living room opens onto the patio. All mod-cons included - see below.

The room: Ground floor, king-size bed, own bathroom directly beside room, high ceilings, good storage. Bright, airy.

The amenities: Clancy Quay includes free resident-only gym, business center with office pods, games room with pool table, cinema room for screenings, mail room for your deliveries, entertainment facilities, playground, landscaped grounds, residents lounge, chef-style kitchen for events, secure bike parking (though our patio is quite safe) and occasional events such as quiz nights. Secure car parking is available for a fee. Maintenance requests through the Clancy Quay app are very prompt.

The area: Good bus links. 15min walk to Heuston. Very close','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 3.03}}',1,NULL);
