Hello,

I''m moving out of my apartment in Laurel Hall, Clay Farm, Leopardstown (D18). The apartment is a 2 bed-2 bath dual aspect, on the 5th floor and the nicest unit in the building. Excellent location - 2 minutes’ walk to The Gallops (Green Line Luas) and 5 minutes’ walk to the Leopardstown Luas stop, Spar, Dunnes superstore, GP and pharmacy. Carrickmines shopping centre is a 5-minute drive.

I am assigning my portion of the lease to a new tenant - you will replace me on the lease contract with a move in date of 1st October. You will be moving into the non-ensuite room and sharing the apartment with another couple.

Rent: €1,348 plus bills (electricity and wi-fi shared equally); deposit €1,348. Bins and one parking spot is included within the rent. Pets are not allowed, unfortunately.

Please get in touch with me for more details.
Prospective tenant will be required to submit these documents directly to the property manageme','Single Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 10.37}}',1,NULL);
