The house was recently renovated so it is bright and clean. The house has double glazed doors and windows. Non-smoking house.

There is on-street parking close to the house. 
Very convenient to Dublin City University - Whitehall & St. Patricks campuses; Beaumont Hospital, City Centre, Airport, M50, and parks. There are good bus links, with the 16 stop on Shantalla Road and bus stops for route 1 and 14 within 5 mins walk. 

