ately','En-suite','Very large, spacious en-suite bedroom in a large three story house in beautiful Laraghcon. Very private accommodation occupying the full top floor, with own en-suite and walk-in closet. The room has a king size bed, matching bed-side lockers, two chests of drawers, and a vanity. 

The house has five bedrooms in total and the room being rented is the largest bedroom. This is a house share with the existing owner family (three people) .

Laraghcon is a very popular residential location being a short walk from picturesque Lucan village and St. Catherines Park, which is very popular for walks on the banks of the Liffey. There are good public transport links with a frequent bus connections to Dublin City Centre, Maynooth, and to both Liffey Valley and Blanchardstown Shopping Centres.

High speed broadband, electricity and gas included.

References required. Contact Fran to arrange a viewing.','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 12.81}}',1,NULL);
