 The Room

* Spacious furnished double bedroom
* Built-in wardrobes
* Full-length mirror
* Desk/workspace
* Plenty of natural light

 The House

* Recently fully renovated
* 2 comfortable communal living areas
* Modern, well-equipped kitchen
* Separate washing & drying facilities
* Private back garden
* High-speed broadband included

 Who we’re looking for
Considerate, respectful and responsible person/s, ideally looking for a long-term home.

The house is shared with the owner and a professional couple, creating a quiet, friendly and respectful household.

 Excellent Location
The property is exceptionally well connected:

*  3-minute walk to Harmonstown DART station
* Easy access to the Howth Road and Malahide Road
* Local shops within walking distance
* Excellent bus connections including 27A, H','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 5.67}}',1,NULL);
