The rent is 950 a month plus bills (electricity and Wi-Fi). The room includes a large wardrobe and has space for a desk. The apartment is owner occupied by a early 30''s male.

It''s a 3rd floor apartment just a 20 minute walk to St. Stephens Green and Grafton street area. There is a Lidl next door and a Centra across the road. It''s on a main bus route to the city centre and its a 5 minute walk to the red Luas line. The Coombe and St. James''s Hospital are both less than a 10 minute walk away.

The apartment is fully furnished and consists of a large living area, kitchen, balcony and bathroom. 

Person must be tidy and a non-smoker. No pets allowed.

If interested in viewing please give a few lines about yourself and a contact number. Unfortunately due to the high number of applicants I wont be able to reply to everyone.','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 2.21}}',1,NULL);
