Room available in a modern, spacious 3-bed apartment in Ropemaker Place, Grand Canal. The apartment gets lots of natural light and offers a great standard of living at a very reasonable rent for the area.

You’ll be sharing with two working individuals (29F & 33M), both working in tech (Salesforce), and both travel frequently and are looking for someone with a similar profile - ideally a young  who is clean, respectful, and easy-going. Both tenants maintain a routine, so the flat is a very calm environment and treated as a place to be able to switch off.

You’ll share a bathroom with just one other flatmate (female). She is very tidy and respectful of shared spaces, and I’ve never had any issues sharing the bathroom with her. Flat cleaning is arranged usually monthly or whenever required.

The location:
Right beside Grand Canal Quay, with everything you need nearby - Fresh for groceries, plenty of cafés and brunch spots','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 1.12}}',1,NULL);
