'Male / Female',0,'Immediately','Shared Bathroom','A bright double bedroom with ample wardrobe space is available immediately,  in a quiet, new-build apartment. 

This short-term stay is for 1 to 3 months, with a possibility to extend. 

You will share the main bathroom and apartment with one professional in their late 30s who values a clean and quiet home. 

The apartment is located 5-minutes walking from the Luas Green Line stop for an easy commute. 

Electricity bill will be split equally. A refundable deposit of 1 month''s rent is required. 

This is a strictly non-smoking, no-party home, and keeping the space clean is non-negotiable.

If you are a clean, respectful person, please send a message with a brief description of yourself and your move-in date to arrange a viewing.','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 13.33}}',1,NULL);
