The room benefits from a good sized wardrobe, chest of drawers and ottoman storage bed. The room has dedicated access to a large private bathroom. 

Room is part of a 3 bed, 2.5 bath duplex apartment with own door access, sharing the apartment with a couple (owner occupied).

The location and amenities can''t be beaten. Close to so many of the major tech companies, law firms, major banks and professional service firms, as well as great bars, restaurants and entertainment venues. 

The kitchen is compact but has everything you need, including a De''Longhi bean to espresso cappuccino maker.

The living area has a very comfortable L-shaped couch, accent chair and large TV.

The owner is in his mid-30s and works in the legal department of a tech company and is into the gym, playing and watching sports. The third bedroom is set up as the owners home office/guest room.

Room is ava','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 1.5}}',1,NULL);
