* Excellent Dublin 4 location close to Merrion Road and Ballsbridge
* Approximately **2.1 km from UCD**
*Approximately 4km from Trinty
* 3-minute walk to frequent bus services
* 7-minute walk to the DART
* Convenient access to Dublin city centre
* Quiet, safe and well-established residential area

**The Accommodation**

* Double bedroom with private ensuite
* Attractive four-bedroom period house in an upmarket
    area
