An amazing location just over 2km from the city centre in a leafy community between Phibsborough and Glasnevin.

City living at its best with numerous cafes, restaurants, bars, supermarkets and shops close by.

All bills are included, i.e., electricity, super-fast Wi-Fi, refuse collection, cleaning, Sky TV and Netflix. The price includes everything. 

All suites are spacious and fully furnished with a private en-suite and the benefits of a separate large kitchen / dining area and living room. 

These suites are only suitable for lone occupancy, however there is an offering for couples at the same location - https://www.daft.ie/share/daneswell-place-dublin-9-drumcondra-dublin-9/6286765

Walking distance to buses, Luas and Drumcondra train station. 

Heat recovery systems provide a continuous fresh clean filtered air supply for a dust and allergy free environment for a healthier standard of living.

