The room is a bright, spacious double, and the apartment itself is much bigger than most places you''ll find around Dublin. It''s a modern duplex with a separate fully equipped kitchen, a comfortable living room, and two and a half bathrooms, so there''s plenty of space and you never feel on top of each other.

One of the things I really like about living here is the location. It''s a quiet area, but you''re only a short walk from parks, cafés, restaurants, pubs and shops. It''s also really easy to get into the city, with regular buses and the Luas nearby.

If you''re looking for a relaxed, clean place to call home, feel free to get in touch and I''d be happy to answer any questions or arrange a viewing.

