Laurel Hall is a professionally managed building with excellent facilities, including 3 rooftop terraces, a TV lounge, a study room, a function room with table tennis and big screen, locked bike storage, car park – you name it, you''ll find it!

The Green Line Luas stop (The Gallops) is just 4 minutes away, taking you into town in about 35 minutes. Leopardstown Valley Shopping Centre (Dunnes, Spar, pharmacies, doctors) is a 5-minute walk. Carrickmines Shopping Centre (with VHI clinic) is about 15 minutes on foot.

