"Alarm"}, {"key": "WASHING_MACHINE", "name": "Washing Machine"}, {"key": "DRYER", "name": "Dryer"}, {"key": "DISHWASHER", "name": "Dishwasher"}, {"key": "INTERNET", "name": "Internet"}, {"key": "GARDEN_PATIO_BALCONY", "name": "Garden / Patio / Balcony"}], "betterBest": false}','2026-09-10T04:02:28.357574+00:00','2026-09-10T18:43:35.311093+00:00',1,0,'daft','EUR',1150,NULL,'2026-09-09',NULL,1,1,'Female',0,'Sep 30th, 2026','Shared Bathroom','Double Room Available – South Dublin
A bright, south-facing double bedroom is available in a lovely 2-bed semi-detached house in South Dublin, with a large private garden.

The room comes furnished with:

Double bed
Chest of drawers
South-facing aspect
The house has a comfortable furnished living room and fully equipped kitchen, including a washing machine and dryer.
Looking for:

Female working professional
Mid-20s to 30s
Social, friendly and respectful
Non-smoker
No pets

You’ll be sharing with one working professional in her mid-20s, so ideally looking for someone who is clean, considerate social 
Deposit: 1 month’s rent
Bills: Additional to rent
South Dublin
Minimum 6 months 

The 150, 16 and 122 bus routes are all in close proximity, making commuting around Dublin convenient.

If interested, please send a message with a little bit about yourself and what you’re looking for in a house share.','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 2.55}}',1,NULL);
