The property is located in a secure gated complex in Ringsend, Dublin 4, in an excellent and convenient location. It is approximately a 20-minute walk from Dublin City Centre and Trinity College.  Shops are 5 minute walk away.  The nearest bus stop is just a 6-minute walk away.  The area also benefits from excellent public transport links, including the DART, Aircoach and several Dublin Bus routes, providing easy access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. 

I’m a friendly and welcoming host who values a calm, clean, and respectful living environment.  The house is not a party place so would suit one individual who likes a quiet environment.  No smoking and no pets allowed.
Please tell me a little about yourself when replying to this ad.  Thank you.','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 2.14}}',1,NULL);
