The flat is a cosy modern 2-bedroom attic space in Portobello. We have a shared bright bathroom, an enclosed kitchen with an open-plan living room and dining. 

You will be sharing the flat with a couple in their early thirties. I''m (Sara) from Russia and Sigurd is from Norway, we''re both working in tech, pretty easygoing, enjoy sports and like to have a relaxing environment at home.

The room would suit a person who goes to the office/uni every day or at least 3 days per week.
The rent is €980 per month. The deposit is €980.
The internet, electricity and all other bills are included.

If this sounds suitable, we''d love to hear from you. Please send us a brief description of yourself, and we''ll try to be in touch as soon as possible!

Regards,
Sara and Sigurd


PS Apologies if we don’t reply to everyone as we have a huge number of applicants!','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 1.73}}',1,NULL);
