It is in the Artane Dublin 5 area. 20 minutes to the city centre by bus or Dart. Bus and train stops are 5 minutes away. The airport is 15 minutes in a taxi. There is free parking and Wi -Fi. A pub, grocery store and fast food restaurants are 1 minute walk. Saint Annes Park is 15 minutes walk. Howth and Malahide are 25 minutes away on the Dart. The house has central heating and an instant shower. The kitchen has a microwave, refrigerator, oven, grill and a washer/dryer. Bill are included.
Guests have access to their bedroom, shared bathroom and kitchen. 
**Rent **
Double/Twin Bedroom.
€1,000 per month for one or €1,300 for two people.
Single Bedroom: €850 per month.
The double/twin bedrooms are private there is no sharing with other people.
