The apartment is flooded with natural light and has great views of the surrounding areas.

The location is excellent, within easy reach of Dundrum Town Centre, Sandyford Industrial Estate and Cherrywood. The LUAS at Glencairn is 10 minutes walk and there are many frequent Dublin bus routes within 5 mins walk such as 47 44 and 114  that services the N11, Stillorgan, Blackrock and City Centre. 

Ample parking is available, and access to a communal garden. 

Amenities such as a Food Market, Restaurant, Hairdresser, Medical Centre and a Community Centre are 2 minutes walk from the apartment. 

Anyone interested, please kindly drop your interest with a brief introduction, or call the number provided. 

Room available immediately.','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 10.09}}',1,NULL);
