The house is bright, modern and extremely spacious, comprising three bathrooms, two separate sitting rooms, and a large open-plan kitchen and dining area that opens out onto a private garden.  Tenants will also have access to their own sitting room.


Key Features:
	•	3 large double bedrooms
	•	3 modern bathrooms
	•	2 separate sitting rooms (one for tenants and other for owner)
	•	Large separate kitchen/dining area
	•	Outdoor garden
	•	Overlooking Sandymount Strand
	•	Recently fully renovated

Additional Details:
	•	Bills not included
	

