A double room with its own private bathroom (located next to the room, not inside) is available in a spacious 2-bedroom apartment in Sandyford.

You’ll be sharing with a relaxed female working professional in her 30s.

Quiet and clean apartment. Looking for someone who is friendly, respectful and will tidy up after themselves.

Location:
•1-minute walk to Flyefit, TRIB3 Gym, and a Pilates studio (with several other gyms under a 5-minute walk away).
•Starbucks, local cafes,  and Dunnes Stores right nearby, plus Aldi just a 5-minute walk away.
•10-minute walk to the Luas Green Line, with bus stops (11, S8, 111) right outside the building.

Other details:
•Rent does not include bills (electricity and broadband are split 50/50; no bin charges).
•Deposit of one months rent is required. 
•No pets and no smoking.
•References required.

