I’m looking for a flatmate to share my modern two-bedroom apartment in Charlemont Square! 
You’ll have a bright double bedroom with your own private bathroom.

About me 
I’m Léonore, I’m French and I work in sales at Google. I appreciate having my own space, but I’m always up for shared dinners, drinks, or activities from time to time. I love cooking, cycling, traveling, and I recently took up kitesurfing and tennis !

Key Details 
 Location: Charlemont Square 
 Available: September 12th 
 Rent: €1,515 / month 
 Bills: Electricity varies, but the building is BER A-rated, so heating is rarely needed in winter 
 House Rules: No pets 
Apartment & Building Perks 
  Secure bike parking
  On-site laundry facilities
  Dedicated storage unit
  Resident rooftop terrace with a BBQ area and garden 

