Spacious double room with built in desk, available in a quiet 3 bedroom top floor apartment in a well located development, sharing with two female housemates. Superb location with great links to public transport and 15 minute walking distance to Dublin City centre. The apartment is well kept, comfortable and fully furnished with a shared kitchen, living and dining space.

- 10 minute walk to Grand Canal Dock Dart Station
- 2 minute walk to various bus stops serving various routes including 60, 82, 77A, 52, C1, C2, C3 & C4
- 10 minute walk to Mayor Square Luas stop
- 2 minute walk to Spar, Fresh, Bord Gais Theatre and various shops, restaurants and cafes.

You would be sharing a bathroom with one other female. One parking space assigned to apartment but currently in use by one tenant.

€1,120 a month. Plus €1,120 deposit.
Bills not included.
Available from 1st October.
Female only. LGBTQ friendly.

Please DM me if interested and send a','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 1.52}}',1,NULL);
