This modern three-bedroom house in Cherry Lane is fully furnished and ready to move into.

Living Room: A spacious area featuring an L-shaped couch and a large TV, perfect for movie nights and sports. You''ll have access to all channels and streaming services, powered by 1GB fibre broadband.

Kitchen: Equipped with new appliances including a coffee machine, air fryer, and induction hob.

Garden: A large south-west facing garden that gets sun from morning until evening — now complete with a putting green and a brand-new barbecue, perfect for relaxing or entertaining outdoors.

Bedroom: The available room is a spacious double with a large floor-to-ceiling window, fitted with curtains and sheers.

About your rommates:
They''re both in their early 30s and from Ireland. One works in fire safety, the other works for a wine wholesaler and is passionate about cooking and wine.

Local Amenities:

Laughanstown Luas Station: 450m, rou','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 13.1}}',1,NULL);
