We''re currently three female workers sharing the place, and we''re after a fourth (also female and worker) to complete the group. The house has a really calm, easygoing vibe.
Sandymount itself is a great spot: quiet, residential, and just a short walk from the sea. You''ve got great bus connections right nearby, plus the DART station close by too, so getting into the city centre (or anywhere else in Dublin) is quick and easy.
