wood (Prime Location)
Rent: €950 per month
Available From: Late September / October 1st
Lease Term: 1 year / Long-term
The Property & Room
We are offering a bright, fully furnished single room in a spacious, modern 3-bedroom duplex located in the heart of Cherrywood.
As shown in the photos, the room features large windows providing plenty of natural light, wood-effect flooring, a comfortable bed, a study/desk setup, a large wardrobe, and a chest of drawers. The property also features a well-built, modern kitchen equipped with all essential appliances. The main bathroom is shared with tidy housemates.
The Location
Unbeatable convenience in a quiet, contemporary development:
 Transport: Just a short walk to the Cherrywood Luas stop, making commuting to the city center or Sandyford effortless, with quick access to the M50.
 Amenities: A convenient Tesco store is right on your doorstep.
 Parking: Includes a dedicated parking space.
The Ho','Single Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 13.19}}',1,NULL);
