>>>>BILLS INCLUDED<<<

About: 

The apartment is located in Dublin 1 in a central location only 15 mins walk from Dublins O''Connell Street. Bus stops is 3 min walk and train stations 10 mins walk.
The apartment is situated in a secure, well kept and quiet block. There is a local supermarket, doctors surgery and pharmacy right across the road and beside the buildings gates. There are also restaurants and more amenities in the surrounding areas.

The apartment: 

The apartment is currently occupied by 2 couples. 
The main bathroom will be exclusively for the new flatmate as the other couple has an ensuite bedroom. 
You will have access to WiFi, Smart TV and all kitchen utilities and utensils.
This is terrace apartment so there is a backyard garden with outdoor storage and bike racks.

You must be: 
Dog lover (we have a little Staffy) 
Clean
Sociable
