nquiries, however this may not be possible. Thank you for your understanding.

Arkcon Property is pleased to present yet another outstanding five-star co-living residence to the Dublin rental market. This latest addition is immaculately presented, as reflected in the accompanying photographs, and has already received an overwhelmingly positive response from prospective tenants. At Arkcon, our vision is to provide high-quality co-living spaces where residents can feel both comfortable and truly at home. Each of our properties is designed to simplify modern urban living—with all utility bills included—allowing our tenants to focus on their personal life and academic pursuits while we handle the rest. This includes gas central heating, high-speed WiFi, electricity, waste ','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 1.28}}',1,NULL);
