Spacious Rooms Available in a Modern Shared House
All bills included.

Located in the sought-after Aikens Village, Dublin 18, this well-maintained shared house offers comfortable accommodation in a quiet residential setting. The property is close to local shops, cafés, public transport, and excellent amenities, making it an ideal choice.

Each room is fully furnished, and tenants share access to a modern kitchen, living area, and all common spaces.

Bedroom 1 First floor – Double Room
A bright and spacious double bedroom featuring a comfortable double bed, ample storage.

Bedroom 2 – Double Room with balcony.
A well-proportioned double bedroom with plenty of natural light. Fully furnished with a double bed and storage, offering a comfortable and practical living space and the added benefit of a private balcony.

Bedroom 3 – Double Room
A premium double bedroom, This spacious room offers comfort, and ample storage','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 9.56}}',1,NULL);
