You’d be sharing with two female professionals in their 30s, and we’re ideally looking for someone friendly, clean and tidy.

The house has a good-sized kitchen and living room, with plenty of space to relax and unwind. The landlord has also recently fitted new carpets upstairs and beautiful wood flooring downstairs, so the house is feeling fresh and bright.

The room
* Good-sized double bedroom
* Double bed
* Built-in wardrobes
* Shared bathroom with one other housemate
* €480 per month
* Bills are separate

We’re a friendly household and enjoy having a chat or the occasional social evening, but we also understand that everyone has their own lives, work and routines. 

