The house is newly furnished throughout and designed to be a comfortable, calm place to live, ideal for person who appreciates a clean, well-kept home.

The room includes:

Comfortable double bed with premium mattress and cosy bedding
Extra Storage under Ottoman Bed
Large built-in wardrobes with excellent storage
Electric sit/stand desk
Comfortable office chair and monitor setup space 
Bedside table and warm ambient lighting
Bright window with curtains
Modern, neutral décor and warm flooring

The house:

Modern A2-rated energy-efficient home
Spacious, fully equipped kitchen with excellent storage
Large fridge/freezer
Miele washing machine and tumble dryer
Ensuite bathroom
Very clean, quiet and relaxing atmosphere
Fitness / pull-up station available
Approx. 7-minute walk to th','Double Room','limerick','{"distances_km": {"centre": 5.56}}',1,NULL);
