We are seeking a quiet, clean, and respectful individual to join our shared apartment.
************************************************

Seeking a responsible, quiet tenant for a well-maintained, fully-furnished room in a professional household. Ideal for serious renters who value privacy, security, & a distraction-free environment.

This is a quiet home with clear boundaries – perfect if you prefer a private living situation without social gatherings/visitors. All housemates respect each other''s space & maintain a peaceful atmosphere.

This household suits someone who:
