**RAY COOKE LETTINGS - PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST ** GREAT LOCATION ** FULLY FURNISHED** AVAILABLE NOW *** HOUSE SHARE *** 

Ray Cooke Lettings is delighted to present this warm and inviting three-bedroom house to the market in the ever-popular and sought-after location of Silken Park, Clondalkin, Dublin 22. This superb development is set close to a wide variety of amenities. It is situated super close (5min drive) to City West Shopping Centre & Clondalkin Village. The house comprises two double bedrooms, one single bedroom, two bathrooms, a lounge, and a kitchen/dining area. There is a rear garden also. The location is unparalleled, with a host of local shops and schools within arm''s reach. The room available is a single bedroom. 

Key Features:

Great value rent

Parking available 

Single bedroom

Immaculate condition 

Exceptional local amenities and transport links nearby, Dublin Bus & LUAS.

Easy Access ','Single Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 9.47}}',1,NULL);
