The room comes with , plenty of wardrobe storage, and access to a shared bathroom.

The location is excellent: Tyrrellstown Park is just a 1minute walk away, and Lidl, SuperValu, restaurants, takeaways, and other local amenities are all within a 5–10-minute walk. Tyrellstown Centre is only 5 minutes on foot, offering supermarkets, a pharmacy, butcher, and more.

Public transport is very convenient, with the 40D (Parnell St), 40E (Broombridge train station & Luas), and 238 (city centre, Broombridge Luas, Blanchardstown Shopping Centre) bus routes just 2 minutes from the house.

The home includes a garden and a fully equipped kitchen with a gas stove, dishwasher, microwave, and other essentials. Central heating, washing machine, dryer, and highspeed internet are also available.

This is a quiet, respectful household :  no pets, no smoking, and no parties.
If you have a','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 11.77}}',1,NULL);
