It is a modern, warm, apartment on the 1st floor, well furnished, open plan living room & kitchen with a smart TV. It has all the usual amenities such as washing machine, dishwasher, fridge, freezer, oven, hob, airfryer

Apartment Block Details:
- Secure, gated community with parking
- Short walk to both the Dundrum & Balally Luas stations
- Easy Access to the M50
- Just up the road from the Dundrum Shopping Centre

Rent: €810 per month
Security Deposit: €785 (refundable upon lease termination and subject to property condition)
Bills: Internet, electricity, heating (Split equally between 3)
(Bins and maintenance charges are included in the rent)

If interested & want more info, please email and also provide some information about yourself.
Cheers!','Double Room','dublin','{"distances_km": {"centre": 7.23}}',1,NULL);
